{
"file": 800,
"paths": [
"d008/d067/f024"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "680ac39d",
"en_raw": "Excuse me, um..."
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "918c3588",
"en_raw": "Are you the strolling old man?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "ae02ee6e",
"en_raw": "Is that you?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "89f958c1",
"en_raw": "...As you see"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "7edf6d86",
"en_raw": "I'm a strolling old man too"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "ccae7453",
"en_raw": "Um, well..."
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "3ead17ee",
"en_raw": "Do you know any other"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "3da9a386",
"en_raw": "strolling old men?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "8d680db4",
"en_raw": "Well, there must be others"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "8a13b034",
"en_raw": "The strolling old man"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "03d986c4",
"en_raw": "Where the strolling old man"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "a0bf9895",
"en_raw": "always went"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "fa6dbd2d",
"en_raw": "do you know?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "dd0513d1",
"en_raw": "Who knows..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "fd2de740",
"en_raw": "Only that every day at the same time"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "1e88ee56",
"en_raw": "he went down the slope and"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "f05e4d52",
"en_raw": "climbed the big stairs, it seemed"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "cf70f837",
"en_raw": "Anyway, since it happened"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "d77b97cd",
"en_raw": "talking about it is painful"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "d2e4b691",
"en_raw": "I naturally kept"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "67c0a98a",
"en_raw": "my distance"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "75096777",
"en_raw": "The grave behind the"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "6faa0ca2",
"en_raw": "north exit building... do you know it?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "e4e0f69c",
"en_raw": "Long ago there certainly was"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "2b9d7d1a",
"en_raw": "a small temple around there"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "36d966ad",
"en_raw": "Is the grave still there?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "854be8af",
"en_raw": "There was a grave"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "6abd65b4",
"en_raw": "marked Yamamoto..."
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "5f0dd723",
"en_raw": "Oh, it's still"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "83c99e6b",
"en_raw": "there, is it"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "9e42be16",
"en_raw": "Do you know it?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "49c015fd",
"en_raw": "That Yamamoto..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "f1ff13ae",
"en_raw": "There's a deli in front"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "8c7ae469",
"en_raw": "of the middle school, right?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "f1f95094",
"en_raw": "It's that family's grave"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "e3815778",
"en_raw": "But... isn't that shop"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "bc34d0eb",
"en_raw": "called Takagiya...?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "7e54aaba",
"en_raw": "Takagi is a shop name"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "4a1d8729",
"en_raw": "the store's name"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "f644381d",
"en_raw": "But that family's surname"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "0530d172",
"en_raw": "is Yamamoto"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "6e94ba11",
"en_raw": "The old man there..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "19ee437d",
"en_raw": "Mr. Yamamoto is a friend of mine"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "892db0b0",
"en_raw": "but I believe his first son"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "7c613102",
"en_raw": "died of illness as a child"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "63b86df8",
"en_raw": "If any grave remains"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "686826e3",
"en_raw": "it might be that one..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "f0be69d8",
"en_raw": "I don't really follow..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "2fa81a83",
"en_raw": "The deli owner"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "9dd921e1",
"en_raw": "is Mr. Yamamoto's second son"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "dae7f99f",
"en_raw": "There was a boy before him"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "029de99a",
"en_raw": "Where is that old man now..."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "467fabea",
"en_raw": "Are the croquettes there"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "625cfd96",
"en_raw": "any good?"
}
]
}